                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Invisibox is a massive brain-melter and an awesome twist on the sliding puzzle genre! The catch is that the boxes you're moving are completely invisible. You have to build a mental map of the grid and track every move entirely in your head. It's a huge test of your short-term memory, but finally solving a tough level is incredibly rewarding.\n\nIf you end up loving this kind of satisfying, experimental spatial logic, I highly recommend checking out these similar games too:\n\nActive Neurons series\n\nSQUASER series\n\nGravity Block\n\nLight Maze\n\nDark Echo\n\nShifter\n\nIt’s a super chill, minimalist game that will absolutely put your galaxy brain to the test. Highly recommend!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1789321790,
